  m_text: Using shield will make you block the incoming damage holding the ability
    button will show a bar that shows you for how long you can keep holding and the
    cooldown will be based on how long you pressed the button except when you only
    press it it will go on full cooldown so you don't spam and while you are blocking
    the enemy will stop hitting you and walk away since they aren't stupid so you
    need to use the shield as parry use it as the enemy is hitting you and they will
    get stunned
